From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LibreTag <dev@libretag.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:45:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 39/40] tracker 0.9.3: every wake-up looks for the owner's
 command advert: a wake-up with no presence or LOST scan (listen-only between
 reports, a check or report without known devices, TRACK) runs a 1.5 s passive
 scan for it alongside the LoRa window or the GPS search; a match at a
 listen-only wake-up looks and reports n + 1 with CMD_ACK; ESP32 holds the
 sleep lock for the scan; blecmd shows scans and first_ms; blescan full

---
 zephcore/src/lt_version.h     |   2 +-
 zephcore/src/main_tracker.cpp | 136 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/zephcore/src/lt_version.h b/zephcore/src/lt_version.h
index 20dec55..8bf7756 100644
--- a/zephcore/src/lt_version.h
+++ b/zephcore/src/lt_version.h
